Rule 5 (subset_by_index ending index must be less than or equal to the minimum of the last two dimensions of input tensor a)
{v_1 : tensor, v_5 : tuple(int)} |= if v_5.len = 2 then (if shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) < shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2) then v_5[1] ≤ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) else v_5[1] ≤ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2))
>>
Rule 6 (input tensor a must have floating-point or complex data type)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) ≥ 6 ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 10
