Rule 12 (if hermitian is true, the input tensor must be square along its last two dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor, v_4 : bool} |= if v_4 = true then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 2)
